Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.66,0:00:06.56,TL,,0,0,0,,做过世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}的斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:10.01,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}次撞上她 {\fs78}6{\fs68}次全输
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.11,0:00:19.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And a reaction to match, Jelena Ostapenko!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赛点拿下 看奥斯塔彭科的反应！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.36,0:00:20.89,TL,,0,0,0,,二零一九伯明翰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.89,0:00:24.61,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}18{\fs68}岁的资格赛小将 撞上法网冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:26.95,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.95,0:00:30.71,TL,,0,0,0,,接发球 {\fs78}38{\fs68}分丢了{\fs78}24{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:33.31,TL,,0,0,0,,两年后印第安维尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.31,0:00:35.49,TL,,0,0,0,,她已是{\fs78}2{\fs68}号种子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.31,0:00:44.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ostapenko breaks. What a first set from Jelena Ostapenko.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奥斯塔彭科破发！首盘打得太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:47.87,TL,,0,0,0,,还是两盘 干脆利落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.06,0:00:52.44,TL,,0,0,0,,二零二二迪拜 她终于先拿一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:58.22,TL,,0,0,0,,可决胜盘 奥斯塔彭科先破发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.86,0:01:03.10,TL,,0,0,0,,抢七{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} 到手的胜利飞了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:06.94,TL,,0,0,0,,此后她{\fs78}37{\fs68}连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.94,0:01:10.09,TL,,0,0,0,,连胜前最后一败 就是这场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.06,0:01:13.99,TL,,0,0,0,,最痛的一次 二零二三美网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.99,0:01:16.77,TL,,0,0,0,,卫冕冠军 世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.86,0:01:18.90,TL,,0,0,0,,她先拿一盘 然后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.90,0:01:21.20,TL,,0,0,0,,奥斯塔彭科提速了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.86,0:01:24.70,TL,,0,0,0,,奥斯塔彭科说 我打得又快又狠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.70,0:01:26.37,TL,,0,0,0,,她就有麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.66,0:01:30.15,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.81,0:01:38.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set, Jelena Ostapenko stuns number one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奥斯塔彭科爆冷击败世界第一！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.06,0:01:42.02,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}75{\fs68}周的王座 到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.02,0:01:45.42,TL,,0,0,0,,她说 突然间 我失去了控制
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.66,0:01:48.32,TL,,0,0,0,,二零二五多哈 {\fs78}3{\fs68}届卫冕冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.32,0:01:50.17,TL,,0,0,0,,又倒在她手里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.81,0:01:56.31,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm just trying to think the last time Swiatek lost a match winning just four games.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她上次只拿四局就输球 是何时？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.61,0:02:00.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She has the winning formula against Swiatek,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她有赢斯瓦泰克的公式
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:05.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as the three-time champion is brushed aside.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N三届冠军被扫地出局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.61,0:02:09.42,TL,,0,0,0,,同年斯图加特 斯瓦泰克扳回一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.81,0:02:12.38,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘 还是她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:18.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is a sensational six in a row{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N惊人的六连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.66,0:02:22.46,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for Jelena Ostapenko against Iga Swiatek.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奥斯塔彭科对斯瓦泰克！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:26.23,TL,,0,0,0,,武汉这一周 两人分处两个半区
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.91,0:02:34.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the final point goes Iga Swiatek's way.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N最后一分 属于斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.66,0:02:36.91,TL,,0,0,0,,第七次 你押谁？
